  "introduction": "Build on Primary 1 knowledge and practise fractions of a whole and a group.",
  "definition": "The denominator is the number of equal parts; the numerator counts the selected parts. To find a unit fraction of a group, divide its size by the denominator. To find several such parts, multiply by the numerator.",
